OL,3,GNEWSAMan detained for Elizabeth Line
OL,4,Astaff punch attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been detained in hospital
OL,7,Findefinitely after he punched an
OL,8,FElizabeth Line railway worker who fell,
OL,9,Fhit his head and died two days later.
OL,11,FJorge Ortega, 61, hit his head on the
OL,12,Fconcrete platform at Ilford station,
OL,13,Feast London, and died of a severe
OL,14,Ftraumatic brain injury on 6 December
OL,15,F2024.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
