OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMan detained for Elizabeth Line
OL,4,Astaff punch attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FAyodele Jamgbadi, 30, of Kingston Road,
OL,7,FIlford, was charged with murder but was
OL,8,Fdeemed unfit to stand trial due to
OL,9,Fsignificant mental health issues. On
OL,10,FWednesday, a jury sitting as part of a
OL,11,Ftrial of issue unanimously agreed that
OL,12,FJamgbadi carried out the act that led
OL,13,Fto Ortega's death.
OL,15,FOrtega's family said in a statement
OL,16,Fthat "he was a loving husband, a
OL,17,Fdevoted father and a wonderful
OL,18,Fgrandfather".
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
